title: "NFL_AB_design: an epitope-conditioned NfL antibody de novo design workflow"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-12"
license: "MIT"
authors:
  - name: "NFL_AB_design contributors"
keywords:
  - NfL
  - NEFL
  - antibody design
  - antigen truncation inference
  - sandwich assay
  - computational workflow
abstract: "A self-contained computational workflow for NfL antigen-truncation inference, dual-framework six-CDR de novo design simulation, prospective candidate ranking, retrospective positive-control assessment, sandwich-pair prioritization, and RFantibody, IgGM, and Germinal handoff."
